  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "add the chopped onion and red bell pepper and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the pomegranate molasses, kosher salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "crack the eggs into a bowl and whisk them lightly.",
    "add the eggs to the skillet and cook until the edges start to set, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "use a spatula to gently scramble the eggs and distribute the ingredients evenly.",
    "transfer the menemen mixture to the banana leaves and fold the leaves over to create a package.",
    "serve immediately, garnished with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "serve 2-3 eggs per person."
